{"v":4,"catch":"超現實，超越現實的超現實！ ！","desc":"《RIDGE RACER》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1993年推出的賽車遊戲。\n使用 3D CG 系統「System 22」體驗虛擬實境的精髓。\n遊戲有四種模式可供選擇，包括三個難度級別 - 新手、中級和高級 - 以及 T.T.（TIME TRIAL），您可以在其中與對手的汽車一對一競爭以取得最佳時間。此外，還包括支援 H 型變速箱和離合器的 DX 版本。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-06-05","genres":["競速","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c72038ebfe727c1ea7ede6b28bcfe5b67fd6f2a475a47bb0f70c523c0334078b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/085b20f80d054aabb723f5e895bb496a1d381198a84320c07fa9f041a3356729.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d984a73aebbf17cc57a4c336c04a7a9c47daf6662e402b74d87ba1521d94d6b3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6df5162e226060f0c059396b029c26de6b80bdee31de3f802092fc16bb07fbe5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e1bae87edc23a1dccf3b594533701bf715aeaccdbd3d98d353843506d69b8039.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/680d09a35d831df41155985ba95250f02baa10bf63824ff0db86266f384e23be.jpg"],"titleId":"010046f022b3a000","dlc":[]}